# placeholder: no real macOS commit-signing key is recorded here.
# each machine generates its own key pair, never a copy of another machine's (see guides/setup.md step 1):
#   ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C "<device-name>-signing" -f ~/.ssh/git_sign_ed25519
# to keep the public half in your own copy, save it as mac/git_sign_ed25519.<device-name>.pub,
# one file per machine with the device name in lowercase. Then delete this placeholder.
